  user_input {
    user_response: "i want a web app, mainly for mobile devices but it should be clean in every design, take care to design separate clean designs for each device type and stuff from the start as doing it in the end doesnt make sense for tracking poems or short stories or just creative writing in general, sign up and sign in using google account, and i want an admin role with complete access, logging type of ui and on click should take me to the writing, i want excellent ui and smooth navigation with dark mode support, also the user should be able to color their own notes with custom themes and categories for better organization. and the writing should be displayed as cards, atleast selectable with some content like the name, author, date of writing, how many likes (they will called \'stars\') and the total number of comments for each entry. Finally, ensure the search functionality is lightning fast. Also, implement an offline mode so users can access their notes anytime. This should sync seamlessly across all devices once an internet connection is established. the themes should be fully customizable, including a dark and light mode for comfort, maybe if its easier we can just give them color options for a personalized user experience and not fully customisable in the true scences, and icons and neat designs included in the themes, like coquette bows, stars or minimalist shapes that match user preferences. This will help ensure the interface feels cohesive and visually appealing. a very big focus is ui and the ease of use and how visually appealing itll be as the actual functionality is not that heavy, we want genz focussed designs, which are sleek and quirky and still look polished. This should also include a dark mode and custom widgets for customization. also have documentation thatll teach me cleanly, about app dev and general things to think about and learn. keep the coding part simple, dont overbuild or overcomplicate. i can use free vercel and free supabase tiers for this, in the start. implement neatly, figure out what u need to think about, plan aggresively and implement\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "i want a web app, mainly for mobile devices but it should be clean in every design, take care to design separate clean designs for each device type and stuff from the start as doing it in the end doesnt make sense for tracking poems or short stories or just creative writing in general, sign up and sign in using google account, and i want an admin role with complete access, logging type of ui and on click should take me to the writing, i want excellent ui and smooth navigation with dark mode support, also the user should be able to color their own notes with custom themes and categories for better organization. and the writing should be displayed as cards, atleast selectable with some content like the name, author, date of writing, how many likes (they will called \'stars\') and the total number of comments for each entry. Finally, ensure the search functionality is lightning fast. Also, implement an offline mode so users can access their notes anytime. This should sync seamlessly across all devices once an internet connection is established. the themes should be fully customizable, including a dark and light mode for comfort, maybe if its easier we can just give them color options for a personalized user experience and not fully customisable in the true scences, and icons and neat designs included in the themes, like coquette bows, stars or minimalist shapes that match user preferences. This will help ensure the interface feels cohesive and visually appealing. a very big focus is ui and the ease of use and how visually appealing itll be as the actual functionality is not that heavy, we want genz focussed designs, which are sleek and quirky and still look polished. This should also include a dark mode and custom widgets for customization. also have documentation thatll teach me cleanly, about app dev and general things to think about and learn. keep the coding part simple, dont overbuild or overcomplicate. i can use free vercel and free supabase tiers for this, in the start. implement neatly, figure out what u need to think about, plan aggresively and implement\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
