  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining App Functionality**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the core functionality. I\'m prioritizing Google sign-in/sign-up and role-based access for an admin. The mobile-first design is crucial, but I\'m thinking about how to provide a clean and functional experience on tablets and desktops, such as a drawer or grid layout. The primary target is a writing tracker for various creative writing formats.\n\n\n**Refining User Interface**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on UI specifics. The entry log will be the primary UI, and on clicking an entry, the writing/reading view will be displayed. I\'m prioritizing smooth navigation and dark mode. I\'m exploring extensive customization options for the color notes, including user-defined themes and categories. Card displays will include title, author, date, star ratings (likes), and total comments. I\'m also planning for fast search and robust offline functionality with local caching and online syncing using IndexedDB or local storage. Lastly, a documentation section teaching development and architecture.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_395510"
