      details: "{\n  \"id\": \"call_240729\",\n  \"name\": \"write_to_file\",\n  \"argumentsJson\": \"{\\\"ArtifactMetadata\\\":{\\\"RequestFeedback\\\":true,\\\"Summary\\\":\\\"Implementation plan for Velours & Verse, a Gen Z aesthetic creative writing tracker and mobile-first web app with custom themes, offline sync, rich card editor, and developer-restricted engineering academy.\\\",\\\"UserFacing\\\":true},\\\"CodeContent\\\":\\\"# Velours & Verse \342\200\224 Creative Writing Tracker & Writer\'s Sanctuary\\\\n\\\\nA mobile-first, aesthetic-rich creative writing tracker and sanctuary for poems, short stories, and prose. Designed with Gen Z aesthetics (Coquette bows, Cyber Y2K stars, Matcha Latte, and Midnight Muse), smooth offline-first sync, rich visual stat cards, and an exclusive Developer Academy accessible strictly to authorized developer accounts (e.g. `hiox2004@gmail.com`).\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### User Review & Critical Decisions\\\\n\\\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\\\n> **Confirmed Choices from Phase 1:**\\\\n> - **Aesthetic Vibes**: 4 curated switchable aesthetics (Coquette Bows \360\237\216\200, Cyber Y2K Stars \342\234\247, Matcha Latte \360\237\214\277, and Midnight Muse \360\237\214\231) across both Light and Dark modes with custom card tint options.\\\\n> - **Writer Experience**: Rich visual cards featuring mood tags, estimated read time, live word count, writing stats, and an aesthetic feel-good editor.\\\\n> - **Developer Academy Access Control**: Restricted Developer Mode accessible exclusively to `hiox2004@gmail.com` and admin-whitelisted email addresses, featuring an App Dev Academy, architecture breakdowns, Supabase/Vercel blueprints, and dev roster controls.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 1. Overview & Core Concept\\\\n\\\\n- **What It Does**: Velours & Verse enables writers, poets, and journalers to capture, track, catalog, star, and reflect upon creative writings on mobile and desktop. It provides an offline-first experience with instant sub-millisecond search, tactile logging, card interactions (stars, comments, custom mood colors), customizable ambience, and a private developer console.\\\\n- **Target Audience / Persona**: Creative writers, poets, student authors, and Gen Z aesthetic enthusiasts looking for a feel-good, distraction-free, yet visually stunning sanctuary for their words.\\\\n- **Key Value**: Delightful, tactile mobile ergonomics with zero-friction offline caching and an aesthetic atmosphere that inspires consistent creative output.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\\\n\\\\n#### Key User Flows\\\\n1. **Onboarding & Auth Flow**:\\\\n   - Clean Google Account Sign-In with instant session persistence.\\\\n   - Detects if the logged-in email matches `hiox2004@gmail.com` or authorized dev roster, unlocking the private Developer Mode badge and Academy drawer.\\\\n2. **Writing Log & Discovery Feed (Mobile-First)**:\\\\n   - Top Bar: Brand wordmark (\\\\\\\"Velours & Verse\\\\\\\"), quick theme switcher, search trigger, and user profile avatar.\\\\n   - Filter & Quick Sort: Filter by format (All, Poetry, Short Stories, Journal, Prose) and mood tags.\\\\n   - Writing Cards: Aesthetic cards showing title, snippet, author, creation date, stars (like toggle), comments counter, word count, read time, and custom pastel tint.\\\\n   - Bottom Tab Navigation (Mobile): Feed / Log, Compose / New Piece, Ambient Sound & Widgets, and Profile (or Dev Academy if authorized).\\\\n3. **Rich Aesthetic Editor & Reader**:\\\\n   - Fluid title and content composition with live word count, reading time calculator, mood tag selector, and custom card color tint palette.\\\\n   - Reading Mode: Distraction-free typography, ambient sound player (synthesized Lo-Fi Vinyl, Rain, Forest Cafe via Web Audio API), font size adjustment.\\\\n   - Commenting & Star System: Interactive commenting stream and instant star counter.\\\\n4. **Offline Mode & Sync**:\\\\n   - IndexedDB/LocalStorage persistence ensures the app functions with zero network latency or completely offline.\\\\n   - Visual Sync Pill indicating \\\\\\\"Synced\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Offline mode (cached locally)\\\\\\\", or \\\\\\\"Syncing...\\\\\\\".\\\\n5. **Private Developer Academy (Restricted to `hiox2004@gmail.com`)**:\\\\n   - Architecture walkthrough: Interactive visualizer explaining Client-Side Offline Caching, Reactive State, Sync Queues, and RBAC.\\\\n   - Supabase & Vercel Launch Kit: Production-ready SQL schema, Row Level Security (RLS) rules, and Vercel configuration files.\\\\n   - Developer Management: Admin interface allowing `hiox2004@gmail.com` to grant or revoke developer status to other user emails.\\\\n\\\\n#### Visual Identity & Theme System\\\\n- **Coquette Blush** \360\237\216\200: Powder pink (`#FFF1F5`), delicate rose gold accents (`#E11D48`), serif typography, dainty bow motifs.\\\\n- **Cyber Y2K Stars** \342\234\247: Iridescent twilight indigo (`#0F172A`), chrome starlight accents (`#6366F1`), metallic border touches, starbursts.\\\\n- **Matcha Latte** \360\237\214\277: Organic soothing sage green (`#164E63`), warm milk froth cream (`#FEFDF8`), botanic leaves.\\\\n- **Midnight Muse** \360\237\214\231: Deep velvet obsidian (`#09090B`), violet and starlight tones (`#8B5CF6`), celestial moons.\\\\n- **Typography**: Editorial display serif for literary elegance paired with clean sans for touch readability, plus tabular figures for word counts and metrics.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\\\n\\\\n- **Zero External Heavy Audio Files**: Ambient audio (Rain, Lo-Fi static, Caf\303\251 chime) generated cleanly via the native Web Audio API synthesis engine. This guarantees immediate zero-latency playback even while completely offline without broken media URLs.\\\\n- **Dual Storage (Offline-First Engine)**: Local writes update client storage immediately and queue background sync events, delivering 0ms UI lag and full offline resilience.\\\\n- **Role-Based Developer Academy**: Developer documentation is gated on the client and server levels based on verified email permissions (`hiox2004@gmail.com`), ensuring normal users experience a clean writing space while the developer retains access to technical lessons.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\\\n\342\224\202                 VELOURS & VERSE ARCHITECTURE                \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\244\\\\n\342\224\202                                                             \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  [ UI Layer: Responsive Mobile-First & Desktop Shell ]      \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Top Bar (Theme switch, Search, Profile)               \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Feed & Writing Logs (Bento / Card Stream)             \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Feel-Good Reader & Editor Modal                       \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Ambient Sound & Habit Widgets Drawer                  \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Restricted Dev Academy (Gated to hiox2004@gmail.com)   \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202                                                             \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  [ State & Business Logic Layer ]                           \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Auth & RBAC Store (Google Auth + Dev Roster)           \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Theme & Aesthetic Context (4 Styles \303\227 Light/Dark)      \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Writing Store (Poems, Stories, Stars, Comments)       \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Ambient Audio Synthesizer (Web Audio API)              \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202                                                             \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  [ Offline & Persistence Layer ]                            \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LocalStorage / IndexedDB Reactive Engine               \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Online / Offline Event Listeners & Queue Sync          \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Supabase / Vercel Export Configuration Kit             \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\202                                                             \342\224\202\\\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n#### Core Data Models\\\\n- `WritingEntry`: id, title, content, type (`poem` | `story` | `prose` | `journal`), authorName, authorEmail, date, starsCount, starredByMe, comments (array of `{id, author, text, timestamp}`), moodTags, colorTheme, wordCount, readTimeMinutes, updatedAt, syncStatus.\\\\n- `UserProfile`: email, name, avatarUrl, role (`developer` | `writer`), createdAt.\\\\n- `DevRoster`: Array of authorized developer emails (initialized with `hiox2004@gmail.com`).\\\\n- `ThemeConfig`: id, name, icon, mode (`light` | `dark`), accentColor, bgClass, cardClass, textClass.\\\\n\\\\n#### Implementation Roadmap\\\\n1. **Core Setup & Theme System**: Build dynamic aesthetic engine with 4 themes, light/dark mode, and CSS token configurations.\\\\n2. **Auth & RBAC**: Google account sign-in with session caching and email-based developer access control for `hiox2004@gmail.com`.\\\\n3. **Writing Engine & Logging Cards**: Card feed with instant fuzzy search, filters, stars, comments, reading time, and word counter.\\\\n4. **Visual Editor & Ambient Player**: Feel-good distraction-free writing editor with live stats, mood badges, color palette, and Web Audio ambient synthesizer.\\\\n5. **Offline Sync Engine**: Auto-save, network status monitor, local caching, and seamless sync queue.\\\\n6. **Exclusive Dev Academy**: Interactive app development modules, architecture visualizer, developer roster admin panel, and Supabase/Vercel setup recipes.\\\\n\\\",\\\"Description\\\":\\\"Create comprehensive implementation plan for Velours & Verse with mobile-first aesthetics, offline sync, rich writing cards, and developer-restricted academy\\\",\\\"Overwrite\\\":true,\\\"TargetFile\\\":\\\".aistudio/artifacts/brain/086428c3-15a4-45b7-9111-0f1b8defc21e/implementation_plan.md\\\",\\\"toolAction\\\":\\\"Creating implementation plan\\\",\\\"toolSummary\\\":\\\"Create implementation plan artifact\\\"}\",\n  \"thoughtSignature\": \"\"\n}"
