            }
            lines {
              text: "#### Implementation Roadmap"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Core Setup & Theme System**: Build dynamic aesthetic engine with 4 themes, light/dark mode, and CSS token configurations."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Auth & RBAC**: Google account sign-in with session caching and email-based developer access control for `hiox2004@gmail.com`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Writing Engine & Logging Cards**: Card feed with instant fuzzy search, filters, stars, comments, reading time, and word counter."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Visual Editor & Ambient Player**: Feel-good distraction-free writing editor with live stats, mood badges, color palette, and Web Audio ambient synthesizer."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **Offline Sync Engine**: Auto-save, network status monitor, local caching, and seamless sync queue."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "6. **Exclusive Dev Academy**: Interactive app development modules, architecture visualizer, developer roster admin panel, and Supabase/Vercel setup recipes."
