  user_input {
    user_response: "for the users we will have drafts and publishes, and we can set up profiles, and add \"penpals\" by uniquely generated ids, display name, profile picture, a get to know me section. the writing can be in draft, published, share with friends. also we should be able to print the writing work with the same clean ui visible and download. the developer mode should get god mode access where they can view the drafts too (ethical moderation) we will mention this in the privacy policy towards launch. the developer should get full display access and account information too. but other users should only get to see display name and other in the webapp data, never the gmail.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nPlan action: revise\nPlan path: .aistudio/artifacts/086428c3-15a4-45b7-9111-0f1b8defc21e/implementation_plan.md\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
