  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Plan Execution**\n\nI\'ve just moved into Phase 3, the Plan Execution stage! I\'m now synthesizing the three context sources. I\'m taking the clarified primary theme \342\200\223 coquette, Y2K stars, matcha, and midnight dark vibes \342\200\223 and the rich visual cards from the writing and editing interface into consideration for execution.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Presentation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on user experience and visual presentation, prioritizing a feel-good factor. I\'m building out features like drafts, published works, and shared content for penpals, each with unique IDs and privacy protections. I\'ve also incorporated offline mode access, lightning-fast search, and custom theming options. Furthermore, the goal is to make the work print with a clean UI via `@media print` formatting and be downloadable as styled cards, Markdown, or TXT. Finally, a dedicated developer academy with interactive architecture and moderation access is in the works!\n\n\n"
