  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI\'m currently working on defining the data structures, specifically `WritingPiece` and `UserProfile`, in `src/types/writing.ts`. I\'ve begun to consider the attributes for `WritingPiece` - poem, story, prose, etc. \342\200\223 including attributes like status (draft, published), engagement (stars, comments), and metadata (read time, word count, mood tags). I am also including privacy-aware author info and considering aesthetics like cardTint. `UserProfile` will include `displayName`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_60006"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type WritingType = \'poem\' | \'story\' | \'prose\' | \'journal\';\\n\\nexport type WritingStatus = \'draft\' | \'published\' | \'penpals\';\\n\\nexport interface CommentItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  authorDisplayName: string;\\n  authorPenpalId: string;\\n  authorAvatar: string;\\n  text: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WritingPiece {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  content: string;\\n  type: WritingType;\\n  status: WritingStatus;\\n  authorId: string;\\n  authorDisplayName: string;\\n  authorPenpalId: string;\\n  authorEmail: string; // Strictly private: never exposed to other writers; visible only to self & Developer God Mode\\n  authorAvatar: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  stars: number;\\n  starredByMe: boolean;\\n  comments: CommentItem[];\\n  moodTags: string[];\\n  cardTint: string;\\n  wordCount: number;\\n  readTimeMinutes: number;\\n  synced: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface UserProfile {\\n  id: string;\\n  email: string; // Private\\n  displayName: string;\\n  penpalId: string; // Unique, e.g. \\\"PEN-9X2M4\\\"\\n  avatar: string;\\n  bio: string;\\n  favoriteDrink: string;\\n  favoriteQuote: string;\\n  writingGoalWords: number;\\n  penpalIds: string[];\\n  role: \'developer\' | \'writer\';\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport type AppView = \'feed\' | \'compose\' | \'penpals\' | \'widgets\' | \'dev_academy\';\\n\\nexport type FeedFilterStatus = \'all\' | \'published\' | \'drafts\' | \'penpals\' | \'starred\';\\n\",\"Description\":\"Define writing, comment, profile, and navigation data structures\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/writing.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing writing types\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create writing and user profile data types\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
