  planner_response {
    response: "I have redesigned the visual architecture and theme system to resolve the legibility issues and deliver a bolder, distinctive aesthetic:\n\n### What Was Improved:\n\n1. **High-Contrast, Readable Light Mode (WCAG AAA)**:\n   - **Razor-Sharp Typography**: Replaced low-contrast muted tones with deep `#18181B` / `#0F172A` headings and `#334155` body text for effortless daylight readability.\n   - **Solid Surface Presence**: Writing cards now feature pure, crisp white surfaces with bold 2px borders (`border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700`) and tactile physical drop-shadows (`shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,0.06)]`), eliminating the washed-out milky overlay.\n   - **Saturated Tint Accent Bars**: Each card receives a distinct, saturated top accent bar (Blush Ribbon, Lilac Dream, Matcha Sage, Cosmic Indigo, Honey Amber) while preserving pure high-contrast reading text inside.\n\n2. **Replaced Emojis with Custom Vector Library Icons**:\n   - Replaced raw emojis across the entire app (top bar, theme picker, cards, mobile navigation) with clean, handcrafted SVG vector stamps:\n     - **Coquette Silk Bow** (`CoquetteBowIcon`)\n     - **Cyber Y2K Chrome Starburst** (`Y2kStarIcon`)\n     - **Matcha Tea Sprig** (`MatchaLeafIcon`)\n     - **Midnight Celestial Moon** (`MidnightMoonIcon`)\n\n3. **Theme-Specific Gen Z Vector Art & Banners**:\n   - Each theme now features an illustrated hand-drawn hero banner at the top of the feed:\n     - **Coquette Blush**: Illustrated silk ribbon bow with trailing lace and delicate rose accents.\n     - **Cyber Y2K**: Starlight wireframe constellation with 4-point chrome starbursts.\n     - **Matcha Latte**: Ceramic latte cup with steaming aroma curves and botanical tea sprigs.\n     - **Midnight Muse**: Hand-drawn crescent moon with celestial orbit stars and constellation lines.\n   - Writing cards now feature subtle theme watermark stamps in the top corner for added tactile personality.\n\n4. **Bolder Controls & Touch Ergonomics**:\n   - Search bar, filter segmented tabs, format buttons, and bottom tab navigation now feature bold 2px borders, tactile active states, and crisp icon labels."
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visual Updates**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the applet\'s code compiles and lints cleanly. Now I\'m carefully reviewing the recent visual updates. My focus is on improving the light mode\'s readability and overall design, ensuring the applet is clear and visually accessible, addressing the user\'s concerns about visibility. The key is in refining the design to create a more effective user experience.\n\n\n**Refining Theming Details**\n\nI\'ve significantly revamped the visual themes. I\'ve abandoned the washed-out backgrounds and low-contrast text in favor of stark, high-contrast typography, achieving WCAG AAA readability. The white card surfaces now have bold borders and subtle drop shadows. Each theme boasts distinctive hand-crafted vector art, such as silk ribbon bows for the \"Coquette Blush Atelier\" theme, and chrome starburst constellations for \"Cyber Y2K Cyber Twilight.\"\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have redesigned the visual architecture and theme system to resolve the legibility issues and deliver a bolder, distinctive aesthetic:\n\n### What Was Improved:\n\n1. **High-Contrast, Readable Light Mode (WCAG AAA)**:\n   - **Razor-Sharp Typography**: Replaced low-contrast muted tones with deep `#18181B` / `#0F172A` headings and `#334155` body text for effortless daylight readability.\n   - **Solid Surface Presence**: Writing cards now feature pure, crisp white surfaces with bold 2px borders (`border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700`) and tactile physical drop-shadows (`shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,0.06)]`), eliminating the washed-out milky overlay.\n   - **Saturated Tint Accent Bars**: Each card receives a distinct, saturated top accent bar (Blush Ribbon, Lilac Dream, Matcha Sage, Cosmic Indigo, Honey Amber) while preserving pure high-contrast reading text inside.\n\n2. **Replaced Emojis with Custom Vector Library Icons**:\n   - Replaced raw emojis across the entire app (top bar, theme picker, cards, mobile navigation) with clean, handcrafted SVG vector stamps:\n     - **Coquette Silk Bow** (`CoquetteBowIcon`)\n     - **Cyber Y2K Chrome Starburst** (`Y2kStarIcon`)\n     - **Matcha Tea Sprig** (`MatchaLeafIcon`)\n     - **Midnight Celestial Moon** (`MidnightMoonIcon`)\n\n3. **Theme-Specific Gen Z Vector Art & Banners**:\n   - Each theme now features an illustrated hand-drawn hero banner at the top of the feed:\n     - **Coquette Blush**: Illustrated silk ribbon bow with trailing lace and delicate rose accents.\n     - **Cyber Y2K**: Starlight wireframe constellation with 4-point chrome starbursts.\n     - **Matcha Latte**: Ceramic latte cup with steaming aroma curves and botanical tea sprigs.\n     - **Midnight Muse**: Hand-drawn crescent moon with celestial orbit stars and constellation lines.\n   - Writing cards now feature subtle theme watermark stamps in the top corner for added tactile personality.\n\n4. **Bolder Controls & Touch Ergonomics**:\n   - Search bar, filter segmented tabs, format buttons, and bottom tab navigation now feature bold 2px borders, tactile active states, and crisp icon labels."
