  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adjusting for Clarity**\n\nI\'ve been reviewing the user\'s feedback concerning the interface\'s color scheme. The primary issue seems to be contrast, particularly the visibility of icons and text against backgrounds. I\'m focusing on making the \"moon\" icon white in light mode and switching the text to black in light mode. I\'m also ensuring that card colors remain constant. My objective is to create clear visual separation.\n\n\n**Optimizing Color Schemes**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the color palette for both light and dark modes. My goal is to maximize contrast and visual appeal. I\'m experimenting with bold, darker shades for the light mode theme\'s card backgrounds, complemented by lighter shades for contrast and text visibility. The light/dark mode switcher will feature high-contrast elements, with a white moon icon in the dark badge for light mode.\n\n\n**Refining Icon Visibility**\n\nI\'m now completely revamping the light/dark mode icon. My aim is guaranteed visibility. In light mode, I\'ll use a dark border and a white \"sun\" icon; dark mode will use a bright, glowing sun. This ensures clarity on any background. I\'m also addressing the text color issue in light mode, making sure all text is pure black for optimal readability. I\'m focusing on card background consistency, making sure backgrounds match the theme, with visibility in mind.\n\n\n**Enhancing Theme Consistency**\n\nI\'m now fully committed to applying each theme\'s specific styling consistently across all cards. For \"Coquette Blush,\" I\'m implementing a soft blush pink background with a bold coquette rose border, pure black text, and a deep berry header. For \"Cyber Y2K,\" I\'m setting a soft cyber lavender background, an electric indigo border, and pure black text to ensure high visibility.\n\n\n**Implementing Theme Specifics**\n\nI\'m now implementing theme-specific styles for Matcha Latte and Midnight Muse. For Matcha, I\'m using a creamy foam background, a deep forest border, pure black text, a forest matcha header accent, and a Matcha Leaf stamp. Midnight Muse features a lilac mist background, midnight purple border, black text, a deep violet accent, and a Crescent Moon stamp. Dark mode will use deep velvet backgrounds and bright borders.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_58011"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type AestheticThemeId = \'coquette\' | \'y2k\' | \'matcha\' | \'midnight\';\\n\\nexport type ThemeMode = \'light\' | \'dark\';\\n\\nexport interface ThemeCardStyle {\\n  bg: string;\\n  border: string;\\n  accentBar: string;\\n  badgeBg: string;\\n  badgeText: string;\\n  starActiveBg: string;\\n  starActiveText: string;\\n  shadow: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AestheticTheme {\\n  id: AestheticThemeId;\\n  name: string;\\n  tagline: string;\\n  motifName: string;\\n  light: {\\n    bg: string;\\n    surface: string;\\n    border: string;\\n    borderStrong: string;\\n    textPrimary: string;\\n    textSecondary: string;\\n    accent: string;\\n    accentHover: string;\\n    card: ThemeCardStyle;\\n  };\\n  dark: {\\n    bg: string;\\n    surface: string;\\n    border: string;\\n    borderStrong: string;\\n    textPrimary: string;\\n    textSecondary: string;\\n    accent: string;\\n    accentHover: string;\\n    card: ThemeCardStyle;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport const THEMES: Record<AestheticThemeId, AestheticTheme> = {\\n  coquette: {\\n    id: \'coquette\',\\n    name: \'Coquette Blush\',\\n    tagline: \'Silk ribbons, delicate prose & sweet melancholia\',\\n    motifName: \'Silk Bow\',\\n    light: {\\n      bg: \'#FFF5F8\',\\n      surface: \'#FFE4EE\',\\n      border: \'#F472B6\',\\n      borderStrong: \'#BE185D\',\\n      textPrimary: \'#000000\', // Pure Solid Black\\n      textSecondary: \'#18181B\', // Deep Black\\n      accent: \'#BE185D\', // Deep Rose Berry\\n      accentHover: \'#9D174D\',\\n      card: {\\n        bg: \'bg-[#FFF0F6]\', // Coquette pastel blush shade\\n        border: \'border-[#BE185D]\', // Bold rich berry ribbon border\\n        accentBar: \'bg-[#BE185D]\',\\n        badgeBg: \'bg-[#FCE7F3]\',\\n        badgeText: \'text-[#9D174D]\',\\n        starActiveBg: \'bg-[#BE185D]\',\\n        starActiveText: \'text-white\',\\n        shadow: \'shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#BE185D]\'\\n      }\\n   