ttributes**\n\nI\'m now detailing a \"Cyber Y2K Stars\" theme, including `accentHover`: `#3730A3`. I\'ve outlined card styles with `bg`, `border`, `accentBar`, `badgeBg`, `badgeText`, `starActiveBg`, `starActiveText`, and `shadow` colors for both light and dark modes. I\'m focusing on futuristic aesthetics, specifically chrome stars, holographic electric lavender, and indigo. I\'m moving onto Matcha Latte next.\n\n\n\n**Constructing Theme Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Matcha Latte\" theme with `#15803D` and relevant accents, defining light and dark modes. I\'m focusing on the card properties, from background to shadows, to make the design match the aesthetic. I\'ve moved onto \"Midnight Muse\", focused on nocturnal aesthetics. I\'m detailing the light mode, including colors and the focus.\n\n\n**Defining Midnight Muse Attributes**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Midnight Muse\" theme, and I\'ve established the light mode attributes. I am now working on specifying the dark mode properties. The \"Midnight Muse\" color scheme is taking shape with `textSecondary`: `#000000` (Pure solid jet black), `accent`: `#6B21A8` (Royal purple), `accentHover`: `#581C87`. For the light mode, the card properties include: `bg` as a dreamy lavender shade `bg-[#EDE9FE]`, a bold royal purple `border-[#6B21A8]`, and a royal purple `accentBar`.\n\n\n"
