  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing UI Element**\n\nI\'ve been examining the implementation of the dark/light mode toggle within `Navigation.tsx`, specifically lines 180-195. It appears to utilize a button element within the desktop top bar for this functionality, and uses tailwind classes for the styling. The `toggleMode` function handles the actual switching.\n\n\n**Refining Mode Implementation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the mobile version of the theme toggle, specifically lines 249-264. It mirrors the desktop implementation but is positioned in the mobile navigation. The same `toggleMode` function is used, though the styling is adapted for the mobile context. I\'m noting the use of utility classes for responsiveness.\n\n\n**Examining Visual Details**\n\nI\'m now diving into the component\'s visual styling, looking closely at the specific classes applied to the mode toggle button, lines 196-224. I\'m focusing on the conditional rendering of the Moon and Sun icons, and the text labels that accompany them, to understand their visual behavior. The transition effects are also of interest. I\'m looking for any edge-cases.\n\n\n**Investigating Component Options**\n\nI\'m now examining the visual treatment of the navigation tabs, particularly the `Writing Log`, `Penpals Circle`, and `Widgets` buttons. I am focusing on their state changes upon selection, with a specific interest in the tailwind classes used for active and inactive states, including color, borders, and opacity transitions. I\'m exploring the nuances of text color alterations in different themes.\n\n\n**Analyzing Tab States**\n\nI\'m now examining the mobile bottom tab bar\'s inactive state styling, specifically noting the intended use of `text-black font-bold` in light mode for inactive items. I am making note of the contrast to active states.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_506377"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Update Navigation with White Moon switcher and solid black high-contrast text in light mode\",\"EndLine\":383,\"Instruction\":\"Update navigation bar with White Moon switcher, solid black typography in light mode, and crisp styling\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"          {/* Offline / Synced Indicator Badge */}\\n          <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 text-black dark:text-zinc-200 border-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-700 font-black shadow-2xs\\\">\\n            {isOnline ? (\\n              <Wifi className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 stroke-[3]\\\" />\\n            ) : (\\n              <WifiOff className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 stroke-[3]\\\" />\\n            )}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-black\\\">\\n              {syncState === \'synced\' ? \'Synced\' : syncState === \'syncing\' ? \'Syncing...\' : \'Offline (Cached)\'}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: Navigation Links (Single-Line, 4-5 Items, Solid Black Text in Light Mode) */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"flex items-center gap-7 text-sm font-black text-black dark:text-zinc-200\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => onSelectView(\'feed\')}\\n            className={`hover:opacity-75 transition-all whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 pb-1 ${\\n              currentView === \'feed\'\\n                ? \'text-black dark:text-white border-b-3 border-black dark:border-white font-black\'\\n                : \'text-black/80 dark:text-zinc-300 font-bold\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Writing Log\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => onSelectView(\'penpals\')}\\n            className={`hover:opacity-75 transition-all whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 pb-1 ${\\n              currentView === \'penpals\'\\n                ? \'text-black dark:text-white border-b-3 border-black dark:border-white font-black\'\\n                : \'text-black/80 dark:text-zinc-300 font-bold\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Penpals Circle\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => onSelectView(\'widgets\')}\\n            className={`hover:opacity-75 transition-all whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 pb-1 ${\\n              currentView === \'widgets\'\\n                ? \'text-black dark:text-white border-b-3 border-black dark:border-white font-black\'\\n                : \'text-black/80 dark:text-zinc-300 font-bold\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Sound & Widgets\\n          </button>\\n          {isDeveloper && (\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => onSelectView(\'dev_academy\')}\\n              className={`flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 pb-1 font-black ${\\n                currentView === \'dev_academy\'\\n                  ? \'text-indigo-800 dark:text-indigo-400 border-b-3 border-indigo-800 dark:border-indigo-400\'\\n                  : \'text-indigo-800 dark:text-indigo-400\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-4 h-4 stroke-[2.5]\\\" />\\n              <span>Dev Academy</span>\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Actions (Theme Picker, Dark Toggle, Profile, New Piece) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0\\\">\\n          {/* Theme Picker Dropdown */}\\n          <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setShowThemePicker(!showThemePicker)}\\n              className=\\\"h-9 px-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-1.5 text-black dark:text-white bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-100 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 border-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-700 transition-colors font-black text-xs shadow-2xs\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Change aesthetic theme\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Change aesthetic theme\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ThemeMotifIcon themeId={themeId} className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline font-black\\\">{theme.name.split(\' \')[0]}</span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {showThemePicker && (\\n              <div className=\\\"absolute right-0 mt-2 w-56 py-2 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-3 border-black dark:border-zinc-700 z-50 animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-100\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-black text-black dark:text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                  Select Aesthetic Theme\\n                </div>\\n                {themeOptions.map(t => (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={t.id}\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setThemeId(t.id);\\n                      setShowThemePicker(false);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={`w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-xs flex items-center justify-between transition-colors ${\\n                      themeId === t.id\\n                        ? \'bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800 font-black text-black dark:text-white\'\\n                        : \'text-black dark:text-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-100 dark:hover:bg-zinc-800/60 font-bold\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-700\\\">\\n                        <ThemeMotifIcon themeId={t.id} className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"font-black text-black dark:text-white\\\">{t.name}</div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-black/70 dark:text-zinc-400 font-bold\\\">{t.motif}</div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </span>\\n                    {themeId === t.id && <Check className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-black dark:text-white stroke-[3]\\\" />}\\n                  </button>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Dark / Light Toggle with explicit White Moon in light mode */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={toggleMode}\\n            className={`h-9 px-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all shadow-sm border-2 ${\\n              mode === \'light\'\\n                ? \'bg-black text-white border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-900\'\\n                : \'bg-amber-400 text-black border-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-300\'\\n            }`}\\n            title={`Switch to ${mode === \'light\' ? \'Dark\' : \'Light\'} Mode`}\\n            aria-label=\\\"Toggle theme mode\\\"\\n          >\\n            {mode === \'light\' ? (\\n              <>\\n                <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-white fill-white stroke-white\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs font-black text-white\\\">White Moon</span>\\n              </>\\n            ) : (\\n              <>\\n                <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-black fill-black stroke-black\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs font-black text-black\\\">Light Sun</span>\\n              </>\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Profile Avatar / Login */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenProfile}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 pl-1.5 pr-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-100 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 border-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-700 transition-colors shadow-2xs\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Open profile & penpal info\\\"\\n          >\\n            <img\\n              src={currentUser.avatar}\\n              alt={currentUser.displayName}\\n              className=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-black dark:ring-white\\\"\\n              referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n            />\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-black text-black dark:text-white max-w-[90px] truncate\\\">\\n              {currentUser.displayName}\\n            </span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Primary Action Button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenNewPiece}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-black text-white bg-black dark:bg-white dark:text-black hover:opacity-90 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all shadow-sm border-2 border-black dark:border-white\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Plus className=\\\"w-4 h-4 stroke-[3]\\\" />\\n            <span>Write Piece</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    {/* MOBILE TOP BAR (High contrast header) */}\\n    <header className=\\\"md:hidden sticky top-0 z-40 backdrop-blur-md bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950 border-b-2 border-black/20 dark:border-zinc-800 px-4 h-14 flex items-center justify-between no-print\\\">\\n      <button\\n        onClick={() => onSelectView(\'feed\')}\\n        className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-left\\\"\\n      >\\n        <div className=\\\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-700\\\">\\n          <ThemeMotifIcon themeId={themeId} className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-black dark:text-white\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n        <span className=\\\"font-display-chic text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-black dark:text-white truncate max-w-[150px]\\\">\\n          Velours & Verse\\n        </span>\\n      </button>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n        <button\\n          onClick={() => setShowThemePicker(!showThemePicker)}\\n          className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-black dark:text-white bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 border-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-700\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Theme\\\"\\n        >\\n          <ThemeMotifIcon themeId={themeId} className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <button\\n          onClick={toggleMode}\\n          className={`h-9 px-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-1 transition-all border-2 ${\\n            mode === \'light\'\\n              ? \'bg-black text-white border-zinc-700\'\\n              : \'bg-amber-400 text-black border-amber-300\'\\n          }`}\\n          aria-label=\\\"Toggle dark mode\\\"\\n        >\\n          {mode === \'light\' ? (\\n            <>\\n              <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-white fill-white stroke-white\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-black text-white\\\">White Moon</span>\\n            </>\\n          ) : (\\n            <>\\n              <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-black fill-black stroke-black\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-black text-black\\\">Sun</span>\\n            </>\\n          )}\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onOpenProfile}\\n          className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center ml-0.5\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Profile\\\"\\n        >\\n          <img\\n            src={currentUser.avatar}\\n            alt={currentUser.displayName}\\n            className=\\\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-black dark:ring-white\\\"\\n            referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n          />\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Theme Popover */}\\n      {showThemePicker && (\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute top-14 right-4 w-52 py-2 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-3 border-black dark:border-zinc-700 z-50\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"px-3.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-black text-black dark:text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n            Aesthetic Styles\\n          </div>\\n          {themeOptions.map(t => (\\n            <button\\n              key={t.id}\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setThemeId(t.id);\\n                setShowThemePicker(false);\\n              }}\\n              className={`w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-xs flex items-center justify-between ${\\n                themeId === t.id\\n                  ? \'bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800 font-black text-black dark:text-white\'\\n                  : \'text-black dark:text-zinc-200 font-bold\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                <ThemeMotifIcon themeId={t.id} className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"font-black\\\">{t.name}</span>\\n              </span>\\n              {themeId === t.id && <Check className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-black dark:text-white stroke-[3]\\\" />}\\n            </button>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </header>\\n\\n    {/* MOBILE FLOATING COMPOSE ACTION BUTTON (Pinned above bottom bar) */}\\n    <div className=\\\"md:hidden fixed bottom-20 right-4 z-40 no-print\\\">\\n      <button\\n        onClick={onOpenNewPiece}\\n        className=\\\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black shadow-2xl border-2 border-white/40 active:scale-95 transition-transform\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"Compose new piece\\\"\\n      >\\n        <Plus className=\\\"w-6 h-6 stroke-[3]\\\" />\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    {/* MOBILE FIXED BOTTOM TAB BAR (Navigation Anchor, Touch targets >= 44px, Solid Black Text in Light Mode) */}\\n    <nav className=\\\"md:hidden fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 backdrop-blur-md bg-white/98 dark:bg-zinc-950/98 border-t-3 border-black/20 dark:border-zinc-800 h-16 grid grid-cols-4 items-center pb-safe no-print\\\">\\n      <button\\n        onClick=