 quiet sanctuary.\'\n                  : \'Start writing your narrative or journal reflection...\'\n              }\n              rows={12}\n              className=\"w-full font-serif-literary text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 placeholder:text-zinc-400 dark:placeholder:text-zinc-600 bg-transparent border-none outline-none focus:ring-0 p-0 resize-none leading-relaxed font-normal\"\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Aesthetic Customization Controls */}\n          <div className=\"pt-4 border-t-2 border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-4\">\n            {/* Card Tint Selection */}\n            <div>\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 mb-2\">\n                <Palette className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                <span>Card Accent Tint</span>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\">\n                {CARD_TINT_OPTIONS.map(opt => (\n                  <button\n                    key={opt.id}\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => setCardTint(opt.id)}\n                    className={`px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center gap-2 border-2 transition-all font-semibold ${\n                      cardTint === opt.id\n                        ? \'border-zinc-950 dark:border-white shadow-xs scale-105 bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-950 dark:text-white\'\n                        : \'border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 hover:border-zinc-400\'\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    <span\n                      className=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full shrink-0 ring-1 ring-black/20\"\n                      style={{ backgroundColor: opt.colorDot }}\n                    />\n                    <span>{opt.name}</span>\n                  </button>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Mood Tags Selection */}\n            <div>\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 mb-2\">\n                <Tag className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                <span>Mood & Aesthetic Tags</span>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\">\n                {suggestedMoods.map(t => (\n                  <button\n                    key={t}\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => handleToggleMoodTag(t)}\n                    className={`px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border transition-all ${\n                      moodTags.includes(t)\n                        ? \'bg-zinc-950 text-white dark:bg-white dark:text-zinc-950 border-zinc-950 dark:border-white shadow-xs\'\n                        : \'bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700 hover:border-zinc-400\'\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    #{t}\n                  </button>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Add Custom Tag */}\n              <form onSubmit={handleAddCustomTag} className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-2\">\n                <input\n                  type=\"text\"\n                  value={newTagInput}\n                  onChange={e => setNewTagInput(e.target.value)}\n                  placeholder=\"Add custom tag (e.g. Moonlight)...\"\n                  className=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 border border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700 outline-none focus:border-zinc-900\"\n                />\n                <button\n                  type=\"submit\"\n                  disabled={!newTagInput.trim()}\n                  className=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-1