            }
            lines {
              text: "  content: \'Welcome to Velours & Verse. I designed this sanctuary for words that refuse to be rushed\342\200\224for verses scribbled in morning light, stories drafted in train stations, and thoughts that keep you company past midnight.\\n\\nTreat your prose with kindness, cherish your penpals, and never apologize for the depth of your feeling. May this space inspire your most honest words.\',"
