  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Author Note Design**\n\nI\'m now structuring the `activeTab === \'author_note\'` section, right after line 463. I\'m focusing on the header card, specifically \"Note from the Author Dispatcher.\" I\'m also planning the explanation of custom messages, clarifying that developers can write tailored notes or broadcasts, which are then rendered.\n\n\n**Designing Dispatch Form**\n\nI\'ve been designing an interactive dispatch form. It will have options to target messages to \"All Writers\" or specific users, with preset titles and category tags like \"Creator Dispatch\" or \"Special Letter.\" The recipient selection will include radio options for broad broadcasts or targeted messages, with the ability to choose from a dropdown of users or enter a custom ID and name. There will be a note content area with a live word count and author name customization.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
