-255\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":437,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:18:43Z\",\"input_tokens\":3126,\"cache_read_tokens\":161111,\"output_tokens\":145,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"345\",\"StartLine\":\"260\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing App.tsx filter tab lines\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 260-345 in App.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":439,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:18:48Z\",\"input_tokens\":4054,\"cache_read_tokens\":162037,\"output_tokens\":2193,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing UI Integration**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on integrating the \\\"Note from the Author\\\" banner. It should go after `ThemeHeroIllustration` in `App.tsx`, lines 235-345. I\'m also revising line 270, specifically the class name, incorporating flexbox adjustments for responsive layout: `flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-3 text-`. I am expecting to make a few additional tweaks but nothing substantial.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add Author Note banner and optimize filter tabs for tablet/mobile in App.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"275\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add Author Note banner card and improve responsive filter tabs\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"            {/* Thematic Gen Z Humanlike Art Illustration Banner */}\\\\n            <ThemeHeroIllustration themeId={themeId} />\\\\n\\\\n            {/* Note from the Author Interactive Themed Card Banner */}\\\\n            {activeAuthorNote && activeAuthorNote.act\\n<truncated 4539 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"234\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"            {/* Thematic Gen Z Humanlike Art Illustration Banner */}\\\\n            <ThemeHeroIllustration themeId={themeId} />\\\\n\\\\n            {/* Feed Control