nder AuthorNoteModal in App.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"532\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add AuthorNoteModal before the closing main div in App.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"      {/* Profile & Google Auth Modal */}\\\\n      <ProfileModal\\\\n        isOpen={isProfileModalOpen}\\\\n        onClose={() => setIsProfileModalOpen(false)}\\\\n      />\\\\n\\\\n      {/* Note from the Author Modal Card (Theme-styled pop-up with smooth folding exit)\\n<truncated 208 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"525\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"      {/* Profile & Google Auth Modal */}\\\\n      <ProfileModal\\\\n        isOpen={isProfileModalOpen}\\\\n        onClose={() => setIsProfileModalOpen(false)}\\\\n      />\\\\n    </div>\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Rendering AuthorNoteModal in App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add AuthorNoteModal component to App.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":447,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:19:38Z\",\"input_tokens\":2843,\"cache_read_tokens\":168939,\"output_tokens\":46,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check compile status after App.tsx update\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":449,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:19:44Z\",\"input_tokens\":2265,\"cache_read_tokens\":169645,\"output_tokens\":145,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ReaderModal.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"140\",\"StartLine\":\"90\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ReaderModal header on tablet and mobile\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ReaderModal lines 90-140\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":451,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:19:47Z\",\"input_tokens\":3664,\"cache_read_tokens\":169726,\"output_tokens\":95,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ReaderModal.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"200\",\"StartLine\":\"141\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ReaderModal lines 141-200\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ReaderModal lines 141-200\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":453,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:19:52Z\",\"input_tokens\":3467,\"cache_read_tokens\":171214,\"output_tokens\":137,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WritingEditor.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"240\",\"StartLine\":\"180\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WritingEditor top bar\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WritingEditor lines 180-240\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":455,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:19:57Z\",\"input_tokens\":3596,\"cache_read_tokens\":172502,\"output_tokens\":112,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View metadata.json\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":457,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:20:01Z\",\"input_tokens\":2513,\"cache_read_tokens\":173955,\"output_tokens\":48,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/index.html\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing index.html\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View index.html\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":459,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:20:05Z\",\"input_tokens\":2911,\"cache_read_tokens\":174312,\"output_tokens\":69,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run compile verification\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":461,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:20:10Z\",\"input_tokens\":2286,\"cache_read_tokens\":175088,\"output_tokens\":54,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run lint check\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":463,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:20:14Z\",\"input_tokens\":2290,\"cache_read_tokens\":175239,\"output_tokens\":1371,\"content\":\"I have implemented the **Note from the Author** system and refined the **Tablet & Mobile UI** layouts:\\n\\n### 1. \\\"Note from the Author\\\" Thematic Pop-Up Card\\n* **Theme-Specific Card Aesthetics**:\\n  * **Coquette Blush**: Soft rosewater gradient with a ruby red border, handcrafted silk bow and vintage wax seal stamp, and postal ribbon accents.\\n  * **Cyber Y2K**: Iridescent lavender and cloud-silver gradient with an electric indigo border, holographic chrome starburst badge, and cyber coordinates `[ + ]`.\\n  * **M\\n<truncated 1974 bytes>\\ntext labels and preserving high-contrast icon buttons, preventing wrapping or header clipping.\\n* **Responsive Card & Feed Layouts**:\\n  * Made the `WritingCard` footer and action buttons wrap cleanly so author information never collides with interaction buttons.\\n  * Updated hero banner heights to responsive minimum heights (`min-h-[124px] md:min-h-[140px] h-auto`) to guarantee zero text clipping on compact screens.\\n  * Improved the filter and format bars with fluid responsive wrapping for tablets and phones.\",\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Current Progress**\\n\\nI\'m pleased to report that the linting and build processes have completed without errors. I\'ve now begun reviewing all accomplishments in response to the user\'s prompt, specifically focusing on the fixes implemented for the tablet and mobile UI. Navigation adjustments, including gap refinements and link optimizations, are top of mind. The Secondary button\'s text is now being examined.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Visual Elements**\\n\\nI\'ve been meticulously refining the UI for different screen \\n<truncated 365 bytes>\\ncard footer is now responsive.\\n\\n\\n**Developing New Modal Functionality**\\n\\nI\'ve just finished implementing a beautifully themed `AuthorNoteModal.tsx` component, creating unique cards for each of the four themes with custom seals and animations. The modal boasts high-contrast typography, an elegant font pairing, and even an author verification badge, all powered by `motion/react` for smooth transitions. I also integrated this modal into Developer Mode, adding a dedicated tab with full customization options.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\",\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":332,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:33:26Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\n-Implement dynamic background gradients for cards based on the selected theme, using CSS background-clip to create a \'glassmorphism\' effect that blends the theme\'s primary color with the content.\\n\\n- expand the dev mode according to yourself, and also remove the words dev academy just that icon is enough and for normal users  itll not be clickable. scope up and improve according to your own ideas. improve visibile ui designs too, but dont touch non dev designs.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-13T09:33:26-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-6ma57ipuaf3mc7mbayx2pf-3063132358.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-6ma57ipuaf3mc7mbayx2pf-3063132358.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: Meher2000.awesome@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":333,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:33:26Z\",\"input_tokens\":7380,\"cache_read_tokens\":18394,\"output_tokens\":843,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Prompt\'s Core**\\n\\nI\'m currently focusing on dissecting the user\'s request. My priority is understanding the intent behind the dynamic background gradients for cards. I\'m especially interested in how to leverage CSS background-clip to achieve that glassmorphism look, blending primary theme colors with the content effectively for various card types, like writing cards, author notes, and feed cards.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Visual Elements**\\n\\nI\'m now zeroing in on the visual implementation, specifically the\\n<truncated 256 bytes>\\nor text accents. My goal is a high aesthetic, legible design that gracefully uses the theme\'s color palette.\\n\\n\\n**Streamlining Navigation Design**\\n\\nI\'m now simplifying the \\\"Dev Academy\\\" button. My plan involves removing the text label and retaining just the icon for a cleaner top bar. For regular users, this icon will be non-clickable, potentially using `disabled`, `pointer-events-none`, or a similar styling approach to ensure it\'s visually inactive. This will improve aesthetics and clarity for all users.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Navigation.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"160\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Navigation.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Navigation.tsx lines 1-160\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}"
