  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising Imports and Tabs**\n\nI\'m currently updating the imports in `DevAcademy.tsx` to include several new icons: `Activity`, `HardDrive`, `Zap`, `CheckCircle2`, `Download`, `AlertCircle`, `Wifi`, and `WifiOff`. Additionally, I\'m expanding the `activeTab` type to incorporate the strings: `\'godmode\'`, `\'author_note\'`, and `\'academy\'`.\n\n\n**Expanding Diagnostics Feature Set**\n\nI\'m now incorporating a \'diagnostics\' tab into the application. This involves adding the appropriate tab button and associated content. Within \'diagnostics\', I\'m focusing on three primary features: live browser storage telemetry & memory footprint, network resilience and chaos offline simulation, and synthetic content generation and seeding. I am excited to see this new tab completed!\n\n\n**Refining Dev Mode UI**\n\nI\'m now focusing on improving the visible UI of Dev Mode. I\'m excited to refine the design of `DevAcademy.tsx`. I will be enhancing the dev mode features based on my own ideas while making sure I do not change the design of any non-dev areas. I also plan to make the Dev Academy icon the only identifier for the dev mode function.\n\n\n"
