e) */}\\\\n      <nav className=\\\\\\\"md:hidden fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 backdrop-blur-md bg-white/98 dark:bg-zinc-950/98 border-t-3 border-bl\\n<truncated 2543 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/Navigation.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating mobile bottom bar\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"5-column mobile bar with icon-only unclickable dev icon\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":398,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:37:51Z\",\"input_tokens\":3424,\"cache_read_tokens\":100804,\"output_tokens\":144,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WritingCard.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"75\",\"StartLine\":\"30\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WritingCard styling\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 30-75 of WritingCard.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":400,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:37:54Z\",\"input_tokens\":3199,\"cache_read_tokens\":102111,\"output_tokens\":2763,\"thinking\":\"**Designing Dynamic Backgrounds**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on implementing dynamic background gradients for cards. The plan is to leverage CSS `background-clip` to achieve a glassmorphism effect, blending the theme\'s primary color with the content within the card. This should create visually appealing and adaptable card designs.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing Theme-Based Gradients**\\n\\nI\'ve defined theme-specific dynamic gradients, blending colors for visual appeal, directly within `WritingCard.tsx`. These gradients, linked \\n<truncated 45 bytes>\\n` to create light and dark variants. I am now working on applying these gradients based on the selected theme, creating a cohesive visual experience.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Background Application**\\n\\nI\'ve updated the implementation to use theme-specific gradients. I am applying dynamic backgrounds to the `<article>` element