source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:38:15Z\",\"input_tokens\":2919,\"cache_read_tokens\":107689,\"output_tokens\":591,\"thinking\":\"**Refining Glassmorphism Aesthetics**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the glassmorphism effect in `AuthorNoteModal.tsx`. I think adding `backgroundClip: \'padding-box\'` on the card element, as seen in lines 155-161, will be beneficial to properly apply `background-clip` and `backdropFilter`. I anticipate this will improve the overall aesthetic.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add CSS background-clip and backdropFilter glassmorphism to AuthorNoteModal\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"162\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add backgroundClip and backdropFilter inline style to motion.div card\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"          transition={{ type: \'spring\', damping: 24, stiffness: 280 }}\\\\n          style={{\\\\n            backgroundClip: \'padding-box\',\\\\n            WebkitBackgroundClip: \'padding-box\',\\\\n            backdropFilter: \'blur(16px)\',\\\\n            WebkitBackdrop\\n<truncated 359 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"154\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"          transition={{ type: \'spring\', damping: 24, stiffness: 280 }}\\\\n          className={`relative w-full max-w-xl my-auto rounded-3xl ${style.wrapperBg} ${style.border} ${style.shadow} p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden transiti\\n<truncated 140 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/AuthorNoteModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating AuthorNoteModal glassmorphism\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add background-clip to AuthorNoteModal card\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":406,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:38:22Z\",\"input_tokens\":3099,\"cache_read_tokens\":108573,\"output_tokens\":531,\"thinking\":\"**Checking Dev Mode Expansion**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on the dev mode expansion. I\'m thinking about how to make it more user-friendly. My plan is to expand the dev mode features and simplify the interface. I\'m considering removing unnecessary words, and making the dev mode icon more obvious while keeping it non-clickable for normal users. I\'m scoping this up to ensure I\'m getting the right fit.\\n\\n\\n**Expanding Dev Mode Capabilities**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into expanding dev mode\'s capabilities, focusing on enriching its functionality within `DevAcademy.tsx`. Specifically, I\'m integrating a Telemetry & System Health Console. This includes a LocalStorage quota monitor, an Audio Engine state inspector, and a Network Emulation/Offline Stress Tester to simulate various network conditions. This should provide high-value, practical tools for developers.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"340\",\"StartLine\":\"270\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DevAcademy tabs\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View DevAcademy tabs 270-340\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":408,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:38:30Z\",\"input_tokens\":2138,\"cache_read_tokens\":111795,\"output_tokens\":109,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"90\",\"StartLine\":\"50\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DevAcademy state and activeTab type\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 50-90 of DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":410,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:38:35Z\",\"input_tokens\":3205,\"cache_read_tokens\":111808,\"output_tokens\":111,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"50\",\"StartLine\":\"30