emy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"1027\",\"StartLine\":\"990\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing end of database tab in DevAcademy\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 990-1027 in DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":430,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:39:45Z\",\"input_tokens\":3109,\"cache_read_tokens\":123642,\"output_tokens\":619,\"thinking\":\"**Calculating Storage Metrics**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on calculating real storage telemetry metrics within `DevAcademy`. I\'ve begun to construct the `getStorageMetrics` function, and am working to quantify the character count and breakdown by key, and I\'m using a `keyBreakdown` array. I\'m leveraging a `try...catch` block to handle potential errors during the storage metric calculation.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Storage Calculations**\\n\\nI\'ve refined the `getStorageMetrics` function to accurately calculate total bytes, kilobytes, and percentage used, and have constructed `keyBreakdown` array. I\'m now integrating this into a storage usage meter, complete with a progress bar and key breakdown display. I\'m also adding a synthetic content generator, which will seed literary pieces, and a function to simulate offline network events. I\'m testing error handling too.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"75\",\"StartLine\":\"55\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing lines 55-75 in DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 55-75 in DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":432,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:39:53Z\",\"input_tokens\":3512,\"cache_read_tokens\":124790,\"output_tokens\":2409,\"thinking\":\"**Implementing Diagnostics Features**\\n\\nI\'m currently working on incorporating a `diagnosticsMessage` state and associated helper functions within `DevAcademy.tsx`. My focus now is prepar