\":141471,\"output_tokens\":124,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/services/storage.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"265\",\"StartLine\":\"220\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking storage.ts reset methods\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View storage.ts reset method\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":452,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:15Z\",\"input_tokens\":3106,\"cache_read_tokens\":141986,\"output_tokens\":217,\"thinking\":\"**Implementing Reset Function**\\n\\nI\'ve added the `resetToDefaultData` function to `StorageService` within `src/services/storage.ts`. This involves setting the `localStorage` with initial data for pieces. The function now correctly sets the storage keys for `PIECES` with the `SEED_PIECES`. This method ensures easy data restoration.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/services/storage.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"20\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DEFAULT profiles in storage.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View DEFAULT profiles in storage.ts\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":454,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:20Z\",\"input_tokens\":3319,\"cache_read_tokens\":143033,\"output_tokens\":99,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/services/storage.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"75\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DEFAULT_ADMIN_PROFILE in storage.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 75-100 in storage.ts\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":456,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":2799,\"cache_read_tokens\":144228,\"output_tokens\":98,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/services/storage.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"310\",\"StartLine\":\"260\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing profile methods in storage.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 260-310 in storage.ts\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":458,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:30Z\",\"input_tokens\":3060,\"cache_read_tokens\":144898,\"output_tokens\":487,\"thinking\":\"**Defining the Lead Developer**\\n\\nI\'ve established that `SEED_USERS[0]` represents the lead developer profile. Now, I\'m integrating a `resetToDefaultData` function within the `StorageService` located in `src/services/storage.ts`. I intend to reset local storage using this function.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add resetToDefaultData method to StorageService\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"428\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add resetToDefaultData method to StorageService\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"      return true;\\\\n    } catch {\\\\n      return false;\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  public static resetToDefaultData(): void {\\\\n    try {\\\\n      localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEYS.PIECES, JSON.stringify(SEED_PIECES));\\\\n      localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEYS.PROFILE, \\n<truncated 313 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"422\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"      return true;\\\\n    } catch {\\\\n      return false;\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/services/storage.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding resetToDefaultData to StorageService\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add resetToDefaultData in storage.ts\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":460,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:35Z\",\"input_tokens\":2981,\"cache_read_tokens\":145897,\"output_tokens\":105,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WritingCard.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"15\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WritingCard top lines\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WritingCard top lines\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":462,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:37Z\",\"input_tokens\":2567,\"cache_read_tokens\":146760,\"output_tokens\":266,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Import AestheticThemeId in WritingCard.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"6\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add AestheticThemeId import from types/theme\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\nimport { WritingPiece } from \'../types/writing\';\\\\nimport { AestheticThemeId } from \'../types/theme\';\\\\nimport { useAuth } from \'../context/AuthContext\';\\\\nimport { useTheme } from \'../context/ThemeContext\';\\\\nimport { ThemeMotifIc\\n<truncated 34 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\nimport { WritingPiece } from \'../types/writing\';\\\\nimport { useAuth } from \'../context/AuthContext\';\\\\nimport { useTheme } from \'../context/ThemeContext\';\\\\nimport { ThemeMotifIcon } from \'./ThemeIllustrations\';\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/WritingCard.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding import to WritingCard\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Import AestheticThemeId in WritingCard.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":464,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:42Z\",\"input_tokens\":2655,\"cache_read_tokens\":147207,\"output_tokens\":48,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run ESLint to check for any lint issues\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":466,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":2260,\"cache_read_tokens\":147751,\"output_tokens\":58,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet to verify build\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":468,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:41:50Z\",\"input_tokens\":2251,\"cache_read_tokens\":147900,\"output_tokens\":1798,\"content\":\"I have completed all requested refinements and expanded the developer platform:\\n\\n### 1. Tablet & Mobile Responsive UI Fixes\\n- **Mobile View 2nd Image / Illustration**: The hand-drawn aesthetic vector illustration in `ThemeHeroIllustration` is now visible on mobile devices with proportional scaling (`w-16 sm:w-28 md:w-36`), perfectly fitting alongside the title without crowding.\\n- **Tablet View Layout**: Refined header spacing and link gaps in `Navigation.tsx` and optimized button text visibility on medium v\\n<truncated 1568 bytes>\\n-only Dev item.\\n- **Expanded Developer Suite**:\\n  - **Live Telemetry & Storage Quota Meter**: Calculates real browser memory footprint, percentage used of 5MB quota, and per-key allocation.\\n  - **Chaos Network Simulator**: Trigger real `offline` and `online` browser events to test offline alerts and sync states live.\\n  - **Batch Creative Seeder**: Generate synthesized masterpiece poems and stories with a single click.\\n  - **WCAG AAA Contrast Bench**: Live swatch matrix verifying theme readability standards.\",\"thinking\":\"**Revising UI Adaptations**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on refining the UI adaptations, particularly for tablet view. Specifically, I\'m working on scaling the header padding and gaps, as well as adapting icon-only elements. I\'m aiming to ensure a seamless and visually pleasing experience across different screen sizes.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Visual Responsiveness**\\n\\nI\'ve been examining the responsiveness across different devices, especially how `hidden lg:inline` affects button labels and names to prevent wrapping. The sea\\n<truncated 648 bytes>\\nnce selection, complete with a live interactive preview for dispatch testing and saving.\\n\\n\\n**Adding Persistent Notes**\\n\\nI\'ve added a \\\"Save Note\\\" button to make personalized welcome notes persist for their target audience, and a \\\"Restore Default Welcome Note\\\" for easy resetting. I\'ve also implemented dynamic, theme-based background gradients for the cards, achieving a glassmorphism effect. This is applied in both the `WritingCard.tsx` and `AuthorNoteModal.tsx` components, with light and dark mode support.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\",\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":331,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:46:07Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nokay so the ui and cards ui we have in writing log is perfect, we want that ui and cards ui for across the project, in penpals circle, sound and widgets, devmode. and also when the written stuff are opened its currently bland, use the themes here too, the ui depth should be spread across everywhere, writing logs is our ui inspiration. especially for cards\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-13T09:46:07-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-6ma57ipuaf3mc7mbayx2pf-3063132358.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-6ma57ipuaf3mc7mbayx2pf-3063132358.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: Meher2000.awesome@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":332,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:46:07Z\",\"input_tokens\":5936,\"cache_read_tokens\":18510,\"output_tokens\":466,\"thinking\":\"**Considering UI Application**\\n\\nI\'ve carefully dissected the request and recognized the core need: consistent UI elements across the project. I\'m focusing on replicating the successful UI and card designs from the writing log into Penpals Circle, Sound & Widgets, and Devmode. Moreover, I\'m now integrating the existing themes into the display of written content for a richer user experience.\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing UI Depths**\\n\\nI\'m now diving deeper into the Writing Logs\' card styling, identifying key elements for replication: dynamic gradients, `backdropFilter` for the frosted glass effect, theme-specific borders and motifs, and high typography contrast. My focus is expanding UI depth and consistency. This includes applying these styles to the written content display, to ensure a cohesive look.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WritingLogs.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WritingLogs.tsx to see opening behavior\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check WritingLogs.tsx\\\"\"}}]}"
