lly dissecting the user\'s prompt to understand the desired UI replication across different project areas. I need to make certain I understand the nuances of the \\\"writing log\\\" UI and its card elements to implement it correctly in penpals circle, sound, widgets, and devmode. I also want to clarify how these elements appear when opened.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WritingCard.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"140\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Inspecting WritingCard.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WritingCard.tsx card structure\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":343,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:46:56Z\",\"input_tokens\":3383,\"cache_read_tokens\":35003,\"output_tokens\":428,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Card Designs**\\n\\nI\'ve been examining the writing card\'s design. I\'m focusing on its dynamic background gradient, which seamlessly mirrors the selected theme using `themeGradients[themeId]`. I\'m also scrutinizing the background clip and backdrop filter properties for a frosted glass effect. Currently, I\'m concentrating on the overlay implementation for that sheen.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ReadingModal.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"120\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ReadingModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ReadingModal.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":345,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:47:00Z\",\"input_tokens\":2609,\"cache_read_tokens\":36400,\"output_tokens\":62,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src/components\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing components directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List components in /src/components\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":347,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:47:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":2308,\"cache_read_tokens\":36945,\"output_tokens\":179,\"thinking\":\"**Integrating UI Themes**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on incorporating UI themes across several components. Specifically, I\'m aiming to apply them to `ReaderModal.tsx` to enhance its visual appeal. Additionally, I\'ll integrate the themes into `PenpalHub.tsx`, and `SoundWidget.tsx` to achieve a more unified design system.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ReaderModal.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"140\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ReaderModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 1-140 of ReaderModal.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":349,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:47:05Z\",\"input_tokens\":2723,\"cache_read_tokens\":39308,\"output_tokens\":96,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ReaderModal.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"280\",\"StartLine\":\"141\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ReaderModal lines 141-280\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ReaderModal.tsx lines 141-280\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":351,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:47:08Z\",\"input_tokens\":2877,\"cache_read_tokens\":42013,\"output_tokens\":91,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ReaderModal.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"343\",\"StartLine\":\"281\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing end of ReaderModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ReaderModal.tsx lines 281-343\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":353,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:47:11Z\",\"input_tokens\":3340,\"cache_read_tokens\":42822,\"output_tokens\":405,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing UI Depth**\\n\\nI\'ve been examining `ReaderModal.tsx`, f