 by integrating `useTheme()` to grab `{ mode, theme, themeId }`. Next, I\'m figuring out how to calculate the `card` for log display. This ties into the UI inspiration from writing logs, especially regarding cards within penpal circles.\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing Visual Elements**\\n\\nI\'ve been examining the detailed visual components now, focusing on how different elements are styled. I\'m noting the application of `glassStyle` and `cardStyle`, the use of accent bars, and the frosted glass overlays. I\'m looking at how these styles apply to the studio banner, and distinct cards. I\'m paying close attention to the visual differences between light and dark modes, and have begun to outline the styling for the mini-card preset buttons, and volume slider.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Infuse SoundWidget cards with writing logs UI style, theme glassmorphism, accent bars, and depth\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"305\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Apply writing log card aesthetic depth and dynamic theme glassmorphism to SoundWidget\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState, useEffect } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { WritingPiece } from \'../types/writing\';\\\\nimport { useAuth } from \'../context/AuthContext\';\\\\nimport { useTheme } from \'../context/ThemeContext\';\\\\nimport { soundStudio, AmbientSoundMode } from \'.\\n<truncated 17295 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState, useEffect } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { WritingPiece } from \'../types/writing\';\\\\nimport { useAuth } from \'../context/AuthContext\';\\\\nimport { useTheme } from \'../context/ThemeContext\';\\\\nimport { soundStudio, AmbientSoundMode } from \'.\\n<truncated 13840 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/SoundWidget.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating SoundWidget with theme cards styling\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Infuse SoundWidget cards with writing logs UI depth\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":383,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:51:33Z\",\"input_tokens\":16283,\"cache_read_tokens\":111925,\"output_tokens\":457,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing DevAcademy\'s UI**\\n\\nI\'m currently focusing on `DevAcademy.tsx` and how its UI design draws inspiration from concepts like \\\"writing logs.\\\" I\'m particularly interested in the card implementations within Dev Mode, and I\'m currently looking into the Quick Metrics cards. I\'m noting the implications of UI paradigms on the cards.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"680\",\"StartLine\":\"600\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DevAcademy roster tab\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 600-680 of DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":385,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:51:39Z\",\"input_tokens\":2166,\"cache_read_tokens\":128249,\"output_tokens\":111,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"360\",\"StartLine\":\"330\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DevAcademy lines 330-360\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 330-360 in DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":387,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:51:44Z\",\"input_tokens\":3024,\"cache_read_tokens\":128323,\"output_tokens\":94,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"75\",\"StartLine\":\"45\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DevAcademy state setup\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 45-75 in DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":389,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T1