"  return (\\\\n    <div className=\\\\\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-md animate-in fade-in duration-200 no-print\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div\\\\n        style={glassStyle}\\\\n        className={`w-full max-w-lg rounded-3xl bord\\n<truncated 1310 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"76\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  return (\\\\n    <div className=\\\\\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-sm animate-in fade-in duration-150 no-print\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div className=\\\\\\\"w-full max-w-lg bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl bord\\n<truncated 788 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/ProfileModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating ProfileModal container styling\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Apply theme glassmorphism to ProfileModal container\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":483,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:58:08Z\",\"input_tokens\":4067,\"cache_read_tokens\":229645,\"output_tokens\":101,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ProfileModal.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"140\",\"StartLine\":\"100\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ProfileModal cards inside body\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 100-140 of ProfileModal.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":485,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:58:11Z\",\"input_tokens\":3087,\"cache_read_tokens\":231630,\"output_tokens\":119,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ProfileModal.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"150\",\"StartLine\":\"115\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ProfileModal identity card\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 115-150 in ProfileModal.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":487,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:58:16Z\",\"input_tokens\":3127,\"cache_read_tokens\":232635,\"output_tokens\":1239,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Style Identity card in ProfileModal with glassStyle and cardStyle.border\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"149\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update identity card in ProfileModal to use glassStyle and theme border\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"          {/* Identity Pill Card */}\\\\n          <div\\\\n            style={glassStyle}\\\\n            className={`p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 ${cardStyle.border} flex items-center justify-between shadow-2xs backdrop-blur-md`}\\\\n          >\\\\n            <div class\\n<truncated 1759 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"114\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"          {/* Identity Pill Card */}\\\\n          <div className=\\\\\\\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800/80 border-2 border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 flex items-center justify-between\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <div className=\\\\\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\\\\\">\\\\n  \\n<truncated 1746 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/ProfileModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating ProfileModal Identity Card\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Apply theme glassmorphism to ProfileModal Identity Card\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":489,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:58:25Z\",\"input_tokens\":2486,\"cache_read_tokens\":235735,\"output_tokens\":54,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet to verify build\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet after full theme integration\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":491,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:58:31Z\",\"input_tokens\":2211,\"cache_read_tokens\":236146,\"output_tokens\":51,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting applet codebase\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Lint applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":493,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T16:58:37Z\",\"input_tokens\":2227,\"cache_read_tokens\":236282,\"output_tokens\":1113,\"content\":\"The design system inspired by the **Writing Log cards** has been extended across the entire application, including the Reader view, Penpal Circle, Sound & Widgets studio, and Dev Mode:\\n\\n### Key Enhancements Implemented\\n\\n* **Themed Reader View (`ReaderModal.tsx`)**:\\n  * **Dynamic Theme Glassmorphism**: When written pieces are opened, the reader modal features dynamic background gradients that blend with the active theme (Coquette Blush, Cyber Y2K, Matcha Latte, Midnight Muse) with `background-clip: padding-b\\n<truncated 1396 bytes>\\norms, Roster access items, Architecture guide chapters, Database backup inspector, and System Telemetry & Chaos Sandbox cards use the Writing Log card styling.\\n  * **Icon-Only Access**: Navigation retains the streamlined developer icon (without extra text), disabled and unclickable for normal users.\\n\\n* **Writing Canvas (`WritingEditor.tsx`) & Profile (`ProfileModal.tsx`)**:\\n  * Composing and account editing modal cards now reflect the same dynamic glassmorphic depth, top accent strips, and frosted overlays.\",\"thinking\":\"**Confirming UI Standards**\\n\\nI\'m pleased to report that the TypeScript compilation and linting are flawless. Now, I\'m shifting focus to meticulously reviewing all user requests. The immediate goal is to ensure complete satisfaction by translating the existing \\\"writing log\\\" UI and card designs consistently across the entire project. This involves carefully cross-referencing specifications and desired outcomes.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing Glassmorphism Styles**\\n\\nI\'ve been immersed in applying consistent glassmorphism styles across various components. Specifically, I\'ve updated the Penpals circle section, incorporating dynamic theme gradients, frosted glass effects, accent strips, and motif icons. The Sound & widgets area also got a glassmorphism makeover, including the Studio banner and various cards. Finally, the Dev mode section, including the banner and cards, is now consistent with the style.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":331,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T17:05:45Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nin user accounts directory i should get to click and open their account details, everything about them which we will have in our db, cleanly displayed in good ui\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-13T10:05:45-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-6ma57ipuaf3mc7mbayx2pf-3063132358.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-6ma57ipuaf3mc7mbayx2pf-3063132358.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: Meher2000.awesome@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":332,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T17:05:45Z\",\"input_tokens\":3416,\"cache_read_tokens\":236593,\"output_tokens\":230,\"thinking\":\"**Visualizing User Accounts**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on how the user account details will be presented within the user accounts directory. My goal is a clean UI that effectively showcases all information stored in the database. I\'ve begun to consider the user interface and how details will be displayed for each account.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"625\",\"StartLine\":\"520\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking User Accounts Directory in DevAcademy\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 520-625 of DevAcademy.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":334,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T17:05:51Z\",\"input_tokens\":2494,\"cache_read_tokens\":240043,\"output_tokens\":379,\"thinking\":\"**Examining Specific Code**\\n\\nI\'ve zeroed in on lines 574-617, specifically the User Accounts Directory table. I\'m focusing on its structure and implementation, especially how the table is rendered and the elements it contains. This will further the goals of analyzing user account directory functionalities. I\'m investigating how this table interacts with other components, looking for integration details.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/types/auth.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking User type in auth.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 1-60 of auth.ts\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":336,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T17:05:59Z\",\"input_tokens\":2574,\"cache_read_tokens\":240540,\"output_tokens\":57,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src/types\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing src/types directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List types directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":338,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T17:06:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":2231,\"cache_read_tokens\":241037,\"output_tokens\":81,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/types/writing.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"70\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing User type in writing.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View User in writing.ts\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":340,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T17:06:07Z\",\"input_tokens\":3125,\"cache_read_tokens\":241184,\"output_tokens\":568,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing User Profile Structure**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on the `UserProfile` interface. I\'ve broken down the key properties: `id`, `email` (which is private), `displayName`, `penpalId` (unique), `avatar`, and `bio`. I\'m examining how each field contributes to the user representation and if any of them need refinement or additional attributes.\\n\\n\\n**Expanding User Data Model**\\n\\nI\'m now integrating richer user data. I\'m incorporating properties for favorite drink and quote, writing goals, and roles. I\'m also including `penpalIds`, and `createdAt` date for account history and network analysis. My focus is on the pieces authored, penpal connections, and account metadata to build a comprehensive user profile. I\'m thinking about metrics like total words, stars and reflections.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/context/AuthContext.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking AuthContext methods\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 1-60 of AuthContext.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":342,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-13T17:06:21Z\",\"input_tokens\":3683,\"cache_read_tokens\":242392,\"output_tokens\":141,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/services/storage.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"35\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing user data in storage.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View lines 35-100 of storage.ts\\\"\"}}]}"
