Actions**\n\nNow, I\'m defining the key \"God Mode\" actions within the developer interface. I\'m focusing on the \"Read & Inspect\" button for database pieces, the \"Switch to/Login As This User\" feature for impersonation, and the \"Dispatch Dedicated Author Note to this User\" action, which pre-fills the form. I\'m also considering the \"Toggle Developer Privileges\" function to modify user access and the \"View Raw Database JSON\" option. I\'ve confirmed that `loginAs` updates and persists the user profile, allowing seamless user switching.\n\n\n"
