  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Component Logic**\n\nI\'ve just reworked a component\'s user data fetching and filtering. I\'ve switched to `useMemo` for both `allUsers` and `filteredUsers`, which should boost performance. Also, I\'m refactoring the data source management for better organization.\n\n\n**Optimizing User Filtering**\n\nI\'ve just refined the user filtering logic. I\'m focusing on making the filters more efficient. I\'ve optimized how I combine role and search queries. I\'m also now handling the developer role toggle more reliably. I\'m aiming for speed and accuracy in the updated implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing User Role Switch**\n\nI\'m now implementing the role switch functionality. I\'ve got the toggle working, updating the user\'s role in storage. Also, I\'m updating the UI and handling state updates after the change, including modal reloads and refresh keys. The storage update is now seamless.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_61558"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Add filteredUsers and user handler functions to DevAcademy.tsx\",\"EndLine\":185,\"Instruction\":\"Replace allUsers declaration with allUsers useMemo, filteredUsers, handleToggleDevRole, handleSwitchToUser, handleTargetAuthorNoteToUser, and handleCopyText\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const allUsers = React.useMemo(() => StorageService.getAllUsers(), [usersRefreshKey]);\\n\\n  const filteredUsers = React.useMemo(() => {\\n    let result = allUsers;\\n    if (userRoleFilter === \'developer\') {\\n      result = result.filter(u => u.role === \'developer\' || devRoster.some(e => e.toLowerCase() === u.email.toLowerCase()));\\n    } else if (userRoleFilter === \'writer\') {\\n      result = result.filter(u => u.role !== \'developer\' && !devRoster.some(e => e.toLowerCase() === u.email.toLowerCase()));\\n    }\\n    if (userSearchQuery.trim()) {\\n      const q = userSearchQuery.toLowerCase().trim();\\n      result = result.filter(u =>\\n        u.displayName.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\\n        u.email.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\\n        u.penpalId.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\\n        (u.bio && u.bio.toLowerCase().includes(q))\\n      );\\n    }\\n    return result;\\n  }, [allUsers, userRoleFilter, userSearchQuery, devRoster]);\\n\\n  const handleToggleDevRole = (user: UserProfile) => {\\n    const isCurrentlyDev = devRoster.some(e => e.toLowerCase() === user.email.toLowerCase()) || user.role === \'developer\';\\n    if (isCurrentlyDev) {\\n      if (user.email.toLowerCase() === SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL.toLowerCase()) {\\n        setDiagnosticsMessage(\\\"Cannot revoke Super Admin role.\\\");\\n        setTimeout(() => setDiagnosticsMessage(null), 3000);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      removeDevEmail(user.email);\\n      const updatedUser: UserProfile = { ...user, role: \'writer\' };\\n      StorageService.updateUserInDirectory(updatedUser);\\n      setSelectedUserForModal(updatedUser);\\n      setUsersRefreshKey(k => k + 1);\\n    } else {\\n      addDevEmail(user.email);\\n      const updatedUser: UserProfile = { ...user, role: \'developer\' };\\n      StorageService.updateUserInDirectory(updatedUser);\\n      setSelectedUserForModal(updatedUser);\\n      setUsersRefreshKey(k => k + 1);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSwitchToUser = (user: UserProfile) => {\\n    loginAs(user);\\n    setSelectedUserForModal(null);\\n    setDispatchSuccessMessage(`Switched active session to ${user.displayName} (${user.email})! You are now viewing the app as this user.`);\\n    setTimeout(() => setDispatchSuccessMessage(null), 4000);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleTargetAuthorNoteToUser = (user: UserProfile) => {\\n    setNoteRecipientType(\'custom\');\\n    setNoteTargetPenpal(user.penpalId);\\n    setNoteTargetName(user.displayName);\\n    setActiveTab(\'author_note\');\\n    setSelectedUserForModal(null);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleCopyText = (val: string, type: \'user\' | \'penpal\') => {\\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(val);\\n    if (type === \'user\') {\\n      setCopiedUserId(val);\\n      setTimeout(() => setCopiedUserId(null), 2000);\\n    } else {\\n      setCopiedPenpalId(val);\\n      setTimeout(() => setCopiedPenpalId(null), 2000);\\n    }\\n  };\",\"StartLine\":182,\"TargetContent\":\"  const allUsers = StorageService.getAllUsers();\",\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/DevAcademy.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Adding user filtering and action helpers\",\"toolSummary\":\"Add user filtering and action helpers in DevAcademy.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
