  planner_response {
    response: "### Enhancements Completed\n\n- **User Accounts Directory & Full Account Dossier Modal**:\n  - Transformed the User Accounts Directory into an interactive card grid adopting the **writing log card glassmorphism aesthetic** (`getThemeGlassCardStyle`), dynamic gradient backgrounds, theme accent bars, and frosted glass overlays.\n  - Added real-time search filtering across display names, emails, penpal IDs, and bios, as well as role filter chips (`All`, `Devs`, `Writers`).\n  - Implemented the **User Account Details Dossier Modal**, which opens upon clicking any user account card or the \"Open Details\" button:\n    - **Database Credentials & Identity**: Internal system ID (`usr_...` with 1-click copy), registration timestamp, private Gmail (unmasked for Lead Dev in God Mode), unique Penpal ID (`PEN-...`), and role toggle.\n    - **Literary Persona**: Bio statement, favorite drink (with coffee icon), favorite literary quote in an editorial quote callout, and daily writing word goal with progress tracked against authored pieces.\n    - **Penpal Circle Network**: Badges of connected penpals with names resolved from the database.\n    - **Authored Writings in DB**: Comprehensive stream of all their pieces (drafts, published, and penpal-shared) with word counts, stars, status badges, and a direct \"Read & Inspect\" button.\n    - **God Mode Controls**: One-click \"Switch Session / Login As\", \"Send Dedicated Author Note\" pre-filling the dispatcher, and an expandable \"Raw Database JSON Record\" viewer.\n\n- **Unified Card UI & Depth Across All Modules**:\n  - **Written Stuff Opened (`ReaderModal.tsx`)**: Replaced the plain dialog with the writing log card depth\342\200\224dynamic theme gradients, frosted sheen overlay, theme motif watermark, parchment reading surface with subtle paper lines, and themed reflection cards.\n  - **Penpal Circle (`PenpalHub.tsx`)**: Infused all correspondence cards, penpal profiles, and stats with theme glassmorphic styling, top accent bars, and corner motif stamps.\n  - **Sound & Widgets (`SoundWidget.tsx`)**: Applied theme card depth to the ambient sound generator studio, writing timer, and daily prompts generator.\n  - **Developer Mode (`DevAcademy.tsx`)**: Applied theme glassmorphism to Header Banners, God Mode metrics, Author Note Dispatcher, Roster Management, Architecture Blueprints, and Diagnostics Sandbox."
    modified_response: "### Enhancements Completed\n\n- **User Accounts Directory & Full Account Dossier Modal**:\n  - Transformed the User Accounts Directory into an interactive card grid adopting the **writing log card glassmorphism aesthetic** (`getThemeGlassCardStyle`), dynamic gradient backgrounds, theme accent bars, and frosted glass overlays.\n  - Added real-time search filtering across display names, emails, penpal IDs, and bios, as well as role filter chips (`All`, `Devs`, `Writers`).\n  - Implemented the **User Account Details Dossier Modal**, which opens upon clicking any user account card or the \"Open Details\" button:\n    - **Database Credentials & Identity**: Internal system ID (`usr_...` with 1-click copy), registration timestamp, private Gmail (unmasked for Lead Dev in God Mode), unique Penpal ID (`PEN-...`), and role toggle.\n    - **Literary Persona**: Bio statement, favorite drink (with coffee icon), favorite literary quote in an editorial quote callout, and daily writing word goal with progress tracked against authored pieces.\n    - **Penpal Circle Network**: Badges of connected penpals with names resolved from the database.\n    - **Authored Writings in DB**: Comprehensive stream of all their pieces (drafts, published, and penpal-shared) with word counts, stars, status badges, and a direct \"Read & Inspect\" button.\n    - **God Mode Controls**: One-click \"Switch Session / Login As\", \"Send Dedicated Author Note\" pre-filling the dispatcher, and an expandable \"Raw Database JSON Record\" viewer.\n\n- **Unified Card UI & Depth Across All Modules**:\n  - **Written Stuff Opened (`ReaderModal.tsx`)**: Replaced the plain dialog with the writing log card depth\342\200\224dynamic theme gradients, frosted sheen overlay, theme motif watermark, parchment reading surface with subtle paper lines, and themed reflection cards.\n  - **Penpal Circle (`PenpalHub.tsx`)**: Infused all correspondence cards, penpal profiles, and stats with theme glassmorphic styling, top accent bars, and corner motif stamps.\n  - **Sound & Widgets (`SoundWidget.tsx`)**: Applied theme card depth to the ambient sound generator studio, writing timer, and daily prompts generator.\n  - **Developer Mode (`DevAcademy.tsx`)**: Applied theme glassmorphism to Header Banners, God Mode metrics, Author Note Dispatcher, Roster Management, Architecture Blueprints, and Diagnostics Sandbox."
